<title>SWITZERLAND: Germany's Schmidt to buy Swiss Rinderknecht-radio.</title>
<headline>Germany's Schmidt to buy Swiss Rinderknecht-radio.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Radio reported that Germany's Bankhaus Schmidt will acquire Bank Rinderknecht AG, a Zurich-based private bank.</p>
<p>Rinderknecht officials were not immediately available to confirm the report.</p>
<p>The radio said Rinderknecht had confirmed it had found a buyer, but would not reveal the name.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
